472,11933],"comment_count":0,"is_following":false,"excerpt":"比如，美国的银行柜台员工是白领，在旧金山的年薪才五万美元左右。美国的小学老师或者中学老师也是白领，在旧金山第一年的年薪不足六万美元。但是美国修车的工人在旧金山的入职年薪是十万美元，扫地工人在旧金山机场加上加班费是十四万美元年薪，修复印机工人也是蓝领，时薪90美元。在美国扫地，修车，修复印机这些都不需要大学学位，但是要当个老师，不仅需要大学学位，还要考入门试，再读两年的师范，至少读六年大学才能有资格考证书试，及格了才能教书。为什么还会有人去当白领比如老师，为什么大家不都全部去当蓝领工人？"},"attached_info":"CkIIo4CUgIK27LcfEAMaCTExMzUwNjAzNyDi1tK9BjAAON0CQBpyCzEyNjUxNDY5NDYyeACqAQliaWxsYm9hcmTSAQA=","detail_text":"50 万热度","trend":0,"debut":false,"children":[{"type":"answer","thumbnail":"https://picx.zhimg.com/80/v2-18133e98e59cc5bbf1976d67ab666130_720w.png"}]},{"type":"hot_list_feed","style_type":"1","id":"27_1746068151.755530","card_id":"Q_1891076236291318840","target":{"id":1891076236291318800,"title":"中国电影应该采取分级制度吗？","url":"https://api.zhihu.com/questions/1891076236291318840","type":"question","created":1743647709,"answer_count":93,"follower_count":118,"author":{"type":"people","user_type":"people","id":"0","url_token":"","url":"","name":"用户","headline":"","avatar_url":"https://pica.zhimg.com/aadd7b895_s.jpg"},"bound_topic_ids":[68,12795,18350,36945],"comment_count":0,"is_following":false,"excerpt":"目前的一刀切是造成电影行业倒退的原因之一嘛？"},"attached_info":"CkkIo4CUgIK27LcfEAMaCTExNDMwOTE2NyDd57e/BjAAOHZAG3ITMTg5MTA3NjIzNjI5MTMxODg0MHgAqgEJYmlsbGJvYXJk0gEA","detail_text":"50 万热度","trend":0,"debut":false,"children":[{"type":"answer","thumbnail":"https://pica.zhimg.com/80/v2-e2d6654104a6c5395acc4065d7c24ed2_720w.png"}]},{"type":"hot_list_feed","style_type":"1","id":"28_1746068151.757405","card_id":"Q_1889949311007192719","target":{"id":1889949311007192800,"title":"当你遇到一个情绪低落的朋友时，你会选择先倾听，还是直接给出建议？","url":"https://api.zhihu.com/questions/1889949311007192719","type":"question","created":1743379029,"answer_count":63,"follower_count":96,"author":{"type":"people","user_type":"people","id":"0","url_token":"","url":"","name":"用户","headline":"","avatar_url":"https://pica.zhimg.com/aadd7b895_s.jpg"},"bound_topic_ids":[404,2246,5993,10115,3076709],"comment_count":0,"is_follow